#: ../../../prop_sf/COMPILE_OPTIONS.rst:2
msgid "COMPILE_OPTIONS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_sf/COMPILE_OPTIONS.rst:6
msgid "List of additional options to pass to the compiler."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_sf/COMPILE_OPTIONS.rst:8
msgid ""
"This property holds a :ref:`semicolon-separated list <CMake Language Lists>` "
"of options and will be added to the list of compile flags when this source "
"file builds.  The options will be added after target-wide options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../include/GENEX_NOTE_PER_SOURCE.rst:2
msgid ""
"Contents of |genex_subject| may use :manual:`generator expressions <cmake-"
"generator-expressions(7)>` with the syntax ``$<...>``.  "
"However, :generator:`Xcode` does not support per-config per-source settings, "
"so expressions that depend on the build configuration are not allowed with "
"that generator."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../include/GENEX_NOTE_SOURCE_TARGET.rst:2
msgid ""
"Generator expressions in |genex_subject| are evaluated separately for each "
"target that compiles the source file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_sf/COMPILE_OPTIONS.rst:16
msgid "Usage example:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_sf/COMPILE_OPTIONS.rst:18
msgid ""
"set_source_files_properties(foo.cpp PROPERTIES COMPILE_OPTIONS \"-Wno-unused-"
"parameter;-Wno-missing-field-initializer\")"
msgstr ""

